#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čisti rubovi u veličini renderiranja igre. DLSS = isto, a povećava sliku kad je Scaling "
"igre ispod 100 %. isklj. = izvorna slika igre: za usporedbu. Sprema se odmah."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Predlošci za vaš GPU. visoko = sve uključeno (model 1). srednje = model 2, prozirna dubina u pola "
"veličine, ravni retrovizori bez pokreta dijelova, lakše traženje pokreta. nisko = i bez DLAA na "
"retrovizorima, bez prozirne dubine, VR područje 60 %. Nikad ne mijenja postavku koju ste sami "
"postavili."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = najviše detalja, najoštriji tekst, oko 1,6x GPU od 2. 2 (E) = uravnoteženo, najmanje "
"sjena iza prometa: počnite ovdje. 3 (F) = najmirniji na ogradama i žicama, može razmazati detalje "
"u pokretu, cijena kao 2. 4 (M) = najteži (oko 5x), samo za ravne testove."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kvaliteta slike: oštrenje, oštrina tekstura, DLAA područje i prozirna dubina. Desno otvara "
"skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Izoštrava sliku nakon DLAA, od 0 (isključeno) do 1.0. Povećajte ako je slika mutna; previsoko "
"daje svijetle oreole na rubovima. Košta oko 0,1 ms; 0 preskače prolaz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Doseg oštrenja, 1 do 4 px: malo = fini detalji, veliko = podebljani rubovi. Promijenite ako je "
"oštrenje presitno ili pregrubo; slika veća od ekrana, kao u VR-u, treba više od 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Oštriji tekst na teksturama (prometni znakovi, ploča s instrumentima, GPS). 0 = isključeno; "
"negativnije = oštrije, ali više treperenja na ogradama; probajte -0,5 do -1 ako je tekst mutan. "
"Bez GPU vremena, samo malo propusnosti memorije."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Isto za žičane ograde, travu i izrezano lišće: povećajte prema 0 ako ograde trepere, smanjite ako "
"je trava mutna. isto = prati gornji red. Radi samo dok Oštrina tekstura nije 0. Bez GPU vremena, "
"malo memorije."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: samo sredina svakog oka dobiva DLAA (20 do 100 %); rub zadržava sliku igre. Smanjite za teži "
"model ili više fps; 40 % košta oko 40 % modela. Određuje i kamion u garaži / glavnom izborniku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravno: DLAA prije bloom / tonemap igre, pa linije na cesti, žice i tračnice manje trepere. "
"Mijenjajte samo za usporedbu. Ne koristi se uz DLSS povećanje ni Windows HDR. Ista cijena; "
"prebacivanje traje ~60 sličica."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Žicama, ogradama i staklu daje vlastitu udaljenost umjesto onoga iza njih, pa se ne razmazuju pri "
"kretanju. Isključite ako ne vidite razmazivanje: štedi 0,02 - 0,06 ms po oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Sprječava da sjaj ulične rasvjete i svjetala auta ostavlja trag pri kretanju: DLSS uzima svaki "
"sjaj iz trenutne sličice, a ne iz povijesti. Koraci od 25 %; smanjite ako sjaj treperi, 0 = "
"isključeno. Košta oko 0,05 - 0,2 ms po oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kako DLAA obrađuje pokretne dijelove i retrovizore kamiona. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je "
"zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Daje svakom pokretnom dijelu (promet, kotači, tablice) vlastito kretanje za DLAA, pa ostaje oštar "
"bez sjena. Isključite samo za uštedu oko 0,5 ms po oku ili test: svi pikseli se tada kreću s "
"kamerom i promet se razmazuje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Daje retrovizorima kamiona vlastiti DLAA da ne trepere. 1 mirror = samo najveći (glavni uz vas). "
"all = svi retrovizori. camera = najjeftinije po retrovizoru, promet u staklu može ostavljati "
"sjene; inače se svaki dio kreće točno u staklu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"uklj. = svaki retrovizor dobiva DLAA svaku 2. sličicu, a između prikazuje zadnju čistu sliku: "
"otprilike pola cijene retrovizora. Rubovi ostaju čisti; pokretno u staklu osvježava se upola "
"sporije. isklj. = svaki retrovizor svaku sličicu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice zadržavaju kretanje dok vozite: DLAA širi podatke o kretanju na tanke linije (DLSS "
"motion dilation). uklj. = zadano. isklj. = samo za usporedbu; bliske žice jače trepere. Slika je "
"na trenutak mutna pri promjeni."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice dobivaju dubinu na svakom pikselu koji dodirnu, ne samo gdje pokrivaju središte "
"piksela. uklj. = zadano. uklj. (no A2C) = i za prozirne rubove. isklj. = samo za usporedbu; "
"bliske žice jače trepere."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno: crta daleke žice tanje od 1 piksela kao liniju od 1 piksela, da se ne raspadaju "
"u crtice. Zadano isključeno: daleke žice mogu izgledati tamnije ili jače treperiti. Isprobajte i "
"usporedite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS povećanje, DLAA uključivanje / isključivanje te informacije o OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Desno "
"otvara skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS vraća sliku na punu veličinu kad je Scaling igre ispod 100 %: oštrije od vlastitog "
"razvlačenja igre, a manje piksela znači više fps. Bez dodatne cijene; ne radi ništa pri Scaling "
"100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje ili isključuje cijeli mod i pamti način rada; isklj. prikazuje izvornu sliku igre, za "
"usporedbu. Isključeno štedi cijenu svih dijelova zajedno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR generiranje sličica od djules75, zasebno preuzimanje "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u ovoj igri i mod propušta "
"njegov rad. Pokrenite njegovu tray aplikaciju prije igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR paket poboljšanja od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"generiranje sličica; pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u igri i mod propušta njegov rad. Pokrenite "
"samo jedan Turbo (njegov ili moda)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR ubrzanja: Turbo, foveated rendering i maska skrivenog područja. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo "
"je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: bez ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojekcije. Samo VR. Uklj. = igra ne čeka slušalice "
"svaku sličicu: više fps samo kad je CPU ograničenje (gužve u gradu, promet). Isključite ako slika "
"zastaje. Iz OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Oštar centar, manje detalja na rubu (samo NVIDIA RTX). Štedi GPU vrijeme pri visokom Scaling. "
"Samo VR. Vanjski prsten se sjenči jednom po 2 x 2 piksela; ograde, trava i lišće zadržavaju sve "
"detalje. Isključite ako rub izgleda blokovito."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Veličina oštrog centra za Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % u koracima od 5 %: veće = više oštrog "
"prizora, manje uštede; manje = više uštede, manje detalja bliže sredini. 80 % (uravnoteženo) je "
"zadano; 90 = široko, 65 = usko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Na koje prolaze igre djeluje Foveated (VRS). scena = samo 3D svijet (zadano). scena + svjetlo = i "
"prolaz osvjetljenja, samo na samom rubu: veća ušteda. Testirajte: tražite blokovite rubove "
"svjetla ili sjene sa strane pogleda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Koliko je grub vanjski prsten Foveated (VRS). Normalno = 1 boja po 2 x 2 piksela (zadano). Jako = "
"po 4 x 2, Maks. = po 4 x 4: veća ušteda GPU-a, blokovitiji rubovi. Najbolje uz praćenje očiju, "
"gdje nikad ne gledate vanjski prsten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno. Oštar centar Foveated (VRS) prati vaše oči na slušalicama s praćenjem očiju "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, npr. Varjo); bez njega ostaje u centru leće. Foveated (VRS) mora biti uključen "
"pri pokretanju igre, inače je potreban restart. Gotovo bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Igra preskače kutove leća koje nikad ne vidite (slušalice ih javljaju), pa crta manje "
"piksela: više GPU rezerve, slika ostaje ista. Prvo uključivanje traži restart igre. Isključite "
"ako rub pogleda izgleda pogrešno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Ograničenja broja sličica i CPU: NVIDIA Reflex i FPS ograničenje za ravno, VR FPS ograničenje, "
"CPU podešavanje. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je "
"zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravno, samo NVIDIA. Uklj. = sličice igre manje čekaju u GPU redu: manje input laga kad je "
"GPU ograničenje. Boost drži i GPU takt visoko. Isti fps; mala cijena. Ne koristi se u VR-u."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravno. Drži igru najviše na ovom broju sličica: ujednačeno vrijeme sličice, manje topline i "
"struje. Postavite malo ispod onoga što vaše računalo drži u prometnom gradu. Uz Reflex ograničava "
"NVIDIA driver. isklj. = bez ograničenja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. polovica = igra crta svaku 2. sličicu slušalica (72 Hz -> 36 fps), trećina = svaku 3.; "
"reprojekcija slušalica (ASW / Motion Smoothing) popunjava ostalo ujednačenim ritmom. Koristite "
"kad fps oscilira. Dok je uključeno, isključuje Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri CPU prekidača zajedno: glavna i render dretva preferiraju P-cores (samo Intelovi hibridni "
"CPU-i), igra radi s prioritetom Above normal, a Windows je ne smije prigušiti (EcoQoS) ni "
"ignorirati njezine zahtjeve za timer. Pomaže kad je CPU ograničenje; bez cijene. Zasebne postavke "
"u dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Položaj, veličina, dubina i okrenutost panela te tipke izbornika. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je "
"zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = panel se kreće sa slušalicama. Fiksno u kabini = ostaje na jednom mjestu "
"ispred sjedala, miran dok gledate uokolo; X / Y / depth tada određuju to mjesto (stupnjevi, "
"metri). Treba VR sloj (zadano). Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče panel u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stupnjevi oko sjedala). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče panel gore / dolje, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stupnjevi, plus = dolje). Ravno i VR "
"pamte svaki svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje panel. Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati, smanjite ako zaklanja previše. "
"Ravno i VR pamte svaki svoju veličinu. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko panel lebdi: u metrima (0,30 - 3,00) kao VR sloj, "
"zadano; u px pomaka prema unutra po oku uz menu_vr_layer = 0. Ista veličina na svakoj dubini. "
"Promijenite ako je gledanje panela zamorno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Uklj. = panel se okreće prema vama kad ga pomaknete u stranu, ista "
"veličina iz svakog kuta (kao VR sloj, zadano, i FPS okvir koji prati glavu); isklj. = ravna "
"slika. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Mali FPS i frame-time okvir uživo, i dok je ovaj izbornik zatvoren (ravno i VR). Koristite za "
"uvid u učinak postavke. Njegova GPU cijena je izmjerena: po sličici, svaka slika u koju se crta; "
"ništa kad je isključen. Save ga pamti za sljedeće pokretanje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zaključavanje, položaj, veličina, boja, VR udaljenost i okretanje FPS okvira. Desno otvara "
"skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = kreće se sa slušalicama. Fiksno u prostoru = jedno mjesto oko sjedala, ne "
"prati njihanje kabine. Zalijepljeno na vozilo = zalijepljen na kabinu, njiše se s njom (treba "
"DLAA + Pokret po dijelovima). Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalijepljeno na vozilo. Uklj. = svaki kamion / auto pamti svoje mjesto FPS okvira u "
"kabini, okretanje, veličinu, boju, svjetlinu i tekst (sprema se u dlaa.ini pri zatvaranju "
"izbornika). Isklj. = jedan zajednički skup za sva vozila. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalijepljeno na vozilo. Desno = ponovno izmjeri kabinu sada (mirno sjedite, parkirano) "
"ako okvir ne stoji dobro. Lijevo = okvir ovog vozila na zadano (mjesto, okretanje, veličina, "
"boja, tekst); druga vozila zadržavaju svoje. Okvir je pravokutan na kabinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče FPS okvir u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stupnjevi oko vas). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče FPS okvir gore / dolje, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stupnjevi, minus = gore). Ravno i "
"VR pamte svaki svoj položaj. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Okreće FPS okvir ulijevo / udesno oko sebe, u stupnjevima (+ = lice se "
"okreće udesno). Koristite za nagib okvira kad je sa strane. 0 = gleda prema vama. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Naginje FPS okvir, u stupnjevima (+ = gornji rub se naginje od vas, "
"kao da leži na instrument ploči). 0 = gleda prema vama. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Rotira FPS okvir u njegovoj ravnini, u stupnjevima (+ = u smjeru "
"kazaljke). 0 = uspravno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje FPS okvir (0,2 .. 3,0). Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati u slušalicama ili "
"na velikom ekranu. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Boja teksta FPS okvira: 20 boja, svaka s obrubom da se čita na svakoj slici (crno na bijelom = "
"tamni tekst, bijeli obrub). Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Svjetlina FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = boja kakva jest, niže zatamnjuje tekst (obrub ostaje) "
"prema crnoj. Koristite za utišavanje brojača noću ili u slušalicama. Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Prozirnost cijelog FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = puno, niže blijedi tekst I crni obrub zajedno, "
"pa zatamnjeni okvir ne postaje crna mrlja. Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko FPS okvir lebdi, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Zadržava istu veličinu u "
"vašem pogledu na svakoj udaljenosti; mijenja se samo dubina. Stavite ga blizu dubine na koju "
"gledate da ga čitate bez ponovnog fokusiranja. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Što ide u dlaa_inject.log: isklj. = ništa; greške = samo greške (zadano); upozorenja = + "
"zaobiđeni problemi; informacije = + pokretanje i promjene; dijagnostika = + statistika, a "
"dijagnostika pokreće i GPU mjerače vremena i CPU profiler."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jezik ovog izbornika. auto = jezik igre (zadano); Lijevo / Desno bira drugi. Linux / Proton: "
"kineski, japanski i korejski traže instalirane fontove, vidi README. Datoteka lang\\<code>.po uz "
"DLL ima prednost, za vaše ispravke. Spremi u dlaa.ini ga pamti. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Sve tipke ovog izbornika, jedan redak po radnji, s tipkom na tipkovnici i gumbom kontrolera. "
"Desno otvara popis; odaberite radnju s Desno, zatim pritisnite novu tipku ili gumb na volanu. "
"Odmah se sprema u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje sve prikazano ovdje u dlaa.ini (postavke te položaje panela / FPS okvira kad ste ih "
"pomaknuli), zadržavajući sve ostale retke. Učinite to kad vam se sviđa što vidite, inače se "
"promjene gube pri sljedećem pokretanju. Način se sprema sam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Vraća sve postavke ovog izbornika na tvorničke (model, oštrenje, oštrina tekstura, DLAA područje, "
"pokret, retrovizori, profil, panel, FPS okvir, turbo, foveated, broj sličica, zapisivanje), uživo "
"i u dlaa.ini, zadržavajući vaše tipke i sve ostale retke."

