#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Back to the main menu. %hs does the same on every line of this page. Every key and controller "
"button except the 5 menu keys still reaches the game while this menu is open, so you can keep "
"driving."
msgstr ""
"Natrag na glavni izbornik. %hs radi isto na svakom retku ove stranice. Svaka tipka i gumb "
"kontrolera osim 5 tipki izbornika i dalje stiže do igre dok je izbornik otvoren, pa možete voziti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key or controller button for %ls: any key, also another menu key (it is taken from "
"it). Keys / buttons already held now are ignored until released. Esc or Backspace cancels, so "
"does 10 s without a press; menu keys cannot be cleared here."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite JEDNU novu tipku ili gumb kontrolera za %ls: bilo koju tipku, i drugu tipku izbornika "
"(oduzima se njoj). Tipke / gumbi koji su već pritisnuti ignoriraju se dok se ne otpuste. Esc ili "
"Backspace odustaje, kao i 10 s bez pritiska; tipke izbornika se ovdje ne mogu obrisati."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Press ONE new key (Shift / Ctrl / Alt with it make a combination) or controller button / D-pad "
"direction. Keys / buttons already held now (a shifter gear) are ignored until released; axes "
"never bind. %hs or Esc cancels, Backspace clears to none, 10 s without a press cancels."
msgstr ""
"Pritisnite JEDNU novu tipku (Shift / Ctrl / Alt uz nju čine kombinaciju) ili gumb kontrolera / "
"smjer D-pada. Tipke / gumbi koji su već pritisnuti (stupanj mjenjača) ignoriraju se dok se ne "
"otpuste; osi se nikad ne vežu. %hs ili Esc odustaje, Backspace briše u nema, 10 s bez pritiska "
"odustaje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"One of the 5 keys that drive this menu (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, then press the new key or button: the "
"other menu keys can be taken too. These lines cannot be cleared, and each of the 5 must keep a "
"binding (a press that leaves another one empty is refused). Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Jedna od 5 tipki koje upravljaju ovim izbornikom (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, zatim pritisnite novu tipku "
"ili gumb: mogu se uzeti i druge tipke izbornika. Ti se retci ne mogu obrisati, a svaka od 5 mora "
"zadržati vezu (pritisak koji bi ostavio drugu praznom odbija se). Odmah se sprema u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
