"controller button or D-pad direction the Controller part. A key / button used by another action "
"moves here. Saved to dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"%ls (dlaa.ini %hs). %hs, zatim pritisnite novu tipku ili gumb: tipka zamjenjuje dio Keyboard, "
"gumb kontrolera ili smjer D-pada dio Controller. Tipka / gumb druge radnje seli se ovamo. Odmah "
"se sprema u dlaa.ini."

